<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>过程②：统一编码与逆映射四步</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03 第二阶段 · 过程</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>连续空间里做差分，离散空间里读决策——这就是「离散映射差分进化」名字的含义。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 620, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, gap: 11}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>统一编码：连续层承载离散决策</Text><Box style={{width: 580, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 6}}><Box style={{width: 230, background: '#E8EFF8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>[0, K) 起始基因</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 342, background: '#F0F5FC', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>[K, N) 巡游基因</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>差分作用在 cost_vector 连续代价指纹上，差分具有「三维航程差」的物理意义；终点巢不进基因（方案 A）。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>SRP 不变式：每任务恰出现一次、无终止基因、基因总数恒 N；起始基因按 UAV 升序，巡游基因紧跟其段。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>逆映射的必要性：变异后的代价值几乎必然不在代价矩阵里（是若干真实值的线性组合），必须有规则把它读回「哪架机飞哪些、按什么顺序」。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 524, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>逆映射四步（「离散映射」的落点）</Text><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 10, paddingRight: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 34, minHeight: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>1</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 448, gap: 2}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>首任务匹配</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>温度自适应 softmax 挑每段第一个任务；T = 1 − g/S 线性衰减，早期软采样保多样性、后期贪心开采。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 10, paddingRight: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 34, minHeight: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>2</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 448, gap: 2}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>巡游边匹配</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>迭代行替换：以上一步选中任务为新起点行继续匹配——访问顺序真正进入搜索空间。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 10, paddingRight: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 34, minHeight: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>3</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 448, gap: 2}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>扰动增强</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>匹配成型后辅以 swap / insert / reverse 三类邻域扰动，概率与温度正相关，跳出贪心路径依赖。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 10, paddingRight: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 34, minHeight: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>4</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 448, gap: 2}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>段结构规范化</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>重建分段，恢复 SRP 不变式；temperature = 0 时逆映射确定、可复现。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>搜索机制：CR(g) = 1 − (log g / log S) 的 ζ 次方（ζ = 3，大 CR 偏探索、小 CR 偏开发）· 混合差分策略（DE/rand/1 ↔ DE/best/2）· 动态 F · GMR = 1 − CR 灭绝重启 · 比较算子默认 penalty</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>主口径 pop50 × gen200；compare_mode 默认 penalty，另有 deb / epsilon / lagaros 对照档；CR 与温度调度以 gen 数为分母。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报（合并版）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>21 / 29</Text></Box></Slide>